# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OKXMonitor — gitignore
# Goal: keep the repo source-only. Build outputs, editor caches,
# OS junk, and the local Claude Code session live outside git.
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Swift Package Manager / build cache
.build/
.swiftpm/
Package.resolved
*.xcodeproj/
*.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
DerivedData/

# Built macOS artifacts (publish via GitHub Releases instead)
OKXMonitor.app/
OKXMonitor.dmg
OKXMonitor-*.dmg
OKXMonitor-*.dmg.zip

# Generated icon assets (regenerate with ./make-icon.sh)
AppIcon.icns
AppIcon.iconset/
icon-master.png

# macOS Finder / spotlight junk
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*
Icon?

# Claude Code session storage (chat history, scratch files)
.claude/

# Superpowers brainstorm/visual-companion scratch files
.superpowers/

# Editor / IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Logs & ad-hoc test outputs
*.log

# Future Windows port (see docs/WINDOWS_PORT.md)
# Common .NET / Visual Studio artifacts:
bin/
obj/
*.user
*.suo
.vs/
TestResults/
*.nupkg
